    ORC --> MCM
    MCM -->|S-CDK plus DDK| CMG
    CMG -->|unwinds dsDNA| Fork
    Fork --> Lead
    Fork --> Lag
    Lead -->|continuous 5to3| Ldone
    Lag --> PrimA
    PrimA --> OkA
    OkA -->|FEN1 flap removal| Nick
    Nick -->|DNA Pol delta fill| Gap
    Gap -->|LIG1 plus ATP| LigDone
    PCNA -->|PIP box| Lead
    PCNA -->|PIP box| OkA
    PCNA -->|PIP box| Nick